## --- AsyncStdin --------------------------------------------------------
##
## Zero-sized handle (the actual state lives in the future). The class
## exists purely so `AsyncStdin.read_line()` reads as a method call
## consistent with `AsyncFile.open(path)` and `AsyncTcpListener.bind(...)`.
class AsyncStdin
  def self.read_line -> AsyncReadLineFuture { AsyncReadLineFuture.new }
end
